*! test_mata_autoload.cscript
*! Regression test — Bug 16: dash.ado did not auto-load dash_parse.mata,
*! causing "_dash_check_utf8() not found" (rc=3499) when any dash subcommand
*! was called without the user having first run dash_parse.mata manually.
*!
*! Fix: top-level findfile/run block in dash.ado locates and runs
*! dash_parse.mata automatically when dash.ado is first loaded by Stata.
*!
*! This test deliberately does NOT pre-load dash_parse.mata.  It invokes
*! the dash command via Stata's normal command dispatch, relying on the
*! current directory (".") being the dash/ package directory.  This matches
*! both the development use-case (running from dash/) and the installed
*! use-case (PLUS/d/ is on the ado-path).
*!
*! Tests: P16A-01 through P16A-03
*!
*! Usage:  cd dash && do test/test_mata_autoload.cscript
*!   (current directory must be dash/ so findfile finds dash_parse.mata)
*!
*! Version: 1.2.0  28mar2026

cscript "dash.ado auto-loads Mata library (Bug 16 regression)" adodir "."

// NOTE: do NOT run dash_parse.mata here — that is the point of this test.
//       dash.ado must load it automatically via its findfile/run mechanism.
//
// adodir "." adds the current directory (dash/) to the ado-path for command
// dispatch AND findfile uses c(adopath) which already includes ".".  So:
//   - "dash clear" triggers command dispatch, finds dash.ado in dash/
//   - inside dash.ado, findfile dash_parse.mata finds dash/dash_parse.mata
//   - capture run compiles the Mata library
//
// Run this test from the dash/ directory (NOT from test/).

// ================================================================
// P16A-01 — dash clear works without prior do dash_parse.mata
//
// Before the Bug 16 fix, this would produce:
//   <istmt>:  3499  _dash_check_utf8() not found
// because _dash_plot called mata: _dash_check_utf8() before dash.ado
// had loaded the Mata library.
// ================================================================
dash clear
display "P16A-01 PASS: dash clear executed without error (auto-load triggered)"

// ================================================================
// P16A-02 — Mata function _dash_check_utf8 is now available
//
// Verify that the auto-load compiled the Mata library:
// _dash_check_utf8 must be callable after the first dash command.
// ================================================================
capture mata: _dash_check_utf8("")
if _rc != 0 {
    display as error "P16A-02 FAIL: _dash_check_utf8() not callable after auto-load"
    display as error "  dash.ado findfile/run block did not compile the Mata library."
    exit 9
}
display "P16A-02 PASS: _dash_check_utf8() callable after auto-load"

// ================================================================
// P16A-03 — All required Mata functions are available after auto-load
// ================================================================
foreach _fn in _dash_check_utf8 _dash_split_segs ///
               _dash_extract_vars {
    capture mata: `_fn'("")
    // rc=3498 (wrong arg count) or rc=0 = function exists
    // rc=3499 (not found) = function missing (FAIL)
    if `=_rc' == 3499 {
        display as error "P16A-03 FAIL: Mata function `_fn'() not found after auto-load"
        exit 9
    }
}
display "P16A-03 PASS: all Mata functions available after auto-load"

display ""
display "All Bug 16 regression tests PASSED."
